section 19 entitled Charges ) charges from Your Cash Account. This does not include any wider charges that could be taken from Your assets which may be payable in addition.
It  is  Your responsibility to ensure there is sufficient cash in Your Cash Account to pay charges due. When there is insufficient cash, We'll disinvest funds to create the additional cash needed to pay these charges.
